ost1443808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some basic observations:<br /> <br /> 1. <b>The Sabbat are back</b>: This isn't really too much of a surprise due to the fact they're getting a book but the statement of Sabbat infiltrators implies that they aren't in too bad of a shape and will once more be playing the sects against one another.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>Convictions replacing Paths</b>: The statement that especially heinous people have Convictions and that they are justified states to me that they'll be expanding the Conviction system and Touchstones to better reflect Sabbat morality.<br /> <br /> 3. <b>Sabbat Attacks Will be a Thing</b>: They won't be the only thing but it seems like the Sword of Caine will be on the offensive again.<br /> <br /> 4. <b>Politics with a renewed focus</b>: It seems like some areas will have treaties between the Anarchs and Camarilla that can and will be tested.<br /> <br /> 5. <b>More Romance</b>: I am tickled by this. I probably shouldn't be but I missed when Kindred were married like the Paynes in 1st Edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Charles,are you a twilight fun? Be honest <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />/JKJK","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-13T16:01:46-07:00","id":1443811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"